            "line": 131,
            "text": "theorem torusMean_intervalIntegral {g : State → F} (hg : Continuous g)\n    {a b : ℝ} (hab : a ≤ b) :\n    torusMean (fun Y => ∫ s in a..b, g (s, Y)) = ∫ s in a..b, sliceMean g s"
